{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"七年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"夏四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"秋，齊侯、鄭伯盟于鹹。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"齊人執衛行人北宮結以侵衛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"齊侯、衛侯盟于沙。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"大雩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"齊國夏帥師伐我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"冬十月。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"七年春二月，周儋翩入于儀栗以叛。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"齊人歸鄆、陽關，陽虎居之以為政。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"夏四月，單武公、劉桓公敗尹氏于窮谷。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"秋，齊侯、鄭伯盟于鹹，徵會于衛。衛侯欲叛晉，諸大夫不可。使北宮結如齊，而私於齊侯曰：「執結以侵我。」齊侯從之，乃盟于瑣。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"齊國夏伐我。陽虎御季桓子，公斂處父御孟懿子，將宵軍齊師。齊師聞之，墮，伏而待之。處父曰：「虎不圖禍，而必死。」苫夷曰：「虎陷二子於難，不待有司，余必殺女。」虎懼，乃還，不敗。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_220_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_220","textTraditional":"冬十一月戊午，單子、劉子逆王于慶氏。晉籍秦送王。己巳，王入于王城，館于公族黨氏，而後朝于莊宮。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}